      "writtenOn": "2024-08-14T18:21:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This works, but:\n\n1. Generally prefer braces to express early drops if you can (you can\u0027t always, but this makes it more readable when it works)\n\n```\n{\n  let mut state \u003d self.state.lock().unwrap();\n  state.mark_starting()?;\n}\n```\n\n2. Because you only have one action guarded by this lock, you can do this much more easily as\n```\nself.state.lock().unwrap().mark_starting()?;\n```",
      "revId": "712ba0c5bf5e83c7c91f91cfcbf3abf7720f0452",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
